ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your exploration unfolds, you will traverse distinctive biomes with unique scenery. You will also face regional puzzles exclusive to each land. Master elemental weapon abilities to solve environmental challenges — for example, using fire-based weapons to melt ice. When faced with obstacles you cannot overcome alone, turn to your loyal monster companions for aid.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412730/extras/2e3ae07e07f9841f2b2c8a5c8a07f570.poster.avif?t=1788316311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412730/extras/2e3ae07e07f9841f2b2c8a5c8a07f570.webm?t=1788316311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412730/extras/2e3ae07e07f9841f2b2c8a5c8a07f570.mp4?t=1788316311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy Workshop allows you to combine various map puzzle mechanics and terrain models to create your own creative maps; saved maps can be directly shared with friends to let them rack their brains and solve your puzzles, every player can become a game creator, and you are welcome to make puzzle maps even more amazing than the official game itself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412730/extras/8c57fa78b0aa08791bff3c536739634b.poster.avif?t=1788316311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412730/extras/8c57fa78b0aa08791bff3c536739634b.webm?t=1788316311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4412730/extras/8c57fa78b0aa08791bff3c536739634b.mp4?t=1788316311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid